# Determining the initial expiry date of the cooperation agreement.

```catala
declaration scope InitialExpiryCalculation:
  input entry_into_force_date content date
  input initial_term content duration
  output initial_expiry_date content date
```

## Initial Expiry Date

The initial expiry date is calculated by adding the initial term duration to the date the agreement enters into force.

```catala
scope InitialExpiryCalculation:
  date round down
  definition initial_expiry_date equals entry_into_force_date + initial_term
```